  "body": "**Original comment by agriggio (Bitbucket: [agriggio](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio), GitHub: [agriggio](https://github.com/agriggio)).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nDo you have tcmalloc enabled? It usually helps in keeping memory usage under control – the memory allocation patterns of ART \\(and RT\\) seem to not play nicely with the default allocator on Linux.\n\nSee the related RT issue:\n\n[https://github.com/Beep6581/RawTherapee/issues/5459](https://github.com/Beep6581/RawTherapee/issues/5459)\n\n‌\n",
